      "question": "Do the dashboard, page and report crumbs go too? The card's build list and title name the object crumb, and that is what this PR removes. The ruled target sentence ('nothing names the page but the page header') reads wider. The dashboard and report views draw their own h1, so their crumb is the same duplicate. The page route's view draws no header of its own. All three crumbs were shaped by the cloud#2768 ruling (objectui#12198, objectui#12273).",
