        "A: keep them (this PR). Measured need: the boards show only the Leads list. Long-term: one app-bar rule, 'object routes draw no crumb', plus a ruled exception set. AI-error axis: n/a (chrome, no metadata). Startup axis: no scope added. Cost 0.",
